Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-15-2000||09:50 PM||||Im just wondering if anyone makes a direct fit cage for a Fiero?? If so how much?? I would LOVE a nice Chrome 2" 4-point  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Haze_sig_1.gif">  My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A>||||reg||5
Z||000001||pherder||07-15-2000||11:01 PM||||Kirk is the only manufacturer of roll bars/cages that I know of.  Everyone that has roll bars/cages for sale is getting them from Kirk.<P>Their ad:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=15329295&Sequence=0"> <P>What one of their roll bars looks like installed:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=15289608&Sequence=1"> <P>I have had both (bar and cage), you just have to watch out when you order because they are shipping the new style that meets SCCA rules and that has a bar that goes across right thru where the ECM is!!!<P>Paul<BR><P>------------------<BR>Paul, Sedgwick, KS<BR>88 Coupe, 88 Formula, 88 GT||||reg||1
